1439:experiment. Table~\ref{tab:hyp} reports their fate, which is part of the
1440:point of specifying them. Two are worth a sentence beyond the verdict. The
1441:GA statement is the one the pilot got right for the wrong reason: the gain
1442:does reverse under a converged budget, as it found on three instances, but
1443:on the cells where that solver's control genuinely converges the reversal
1444:reverses again. And statement (v) is the one the experiment contradicts
1445:outright; it is the observation that reoriented the mechanism analysis of
1446:Section~\ref{sec:discussion}.
