.\review\codex_run4.log:31:2. **Section 4.4, seed-generation cost.** GP and GT were timed directly; the learned policy's pool cost is extrapolated from per-rollout inference and MOR was never timed. The section argues the short-budget advantage survives only if the pool is reused across runs. Check the arithmetic and whether the conclusion is stated at the right strength.
