The arithmetic now makes the central weakness sharper: the four GA cell means are descriptively close to additive (interaction about +0.056 RPD points), but the paper never tests that interaction. More importantly, the “fraction” comparison changes the checkpoint mixture—V2H receives only 27.3% from checkpoint 3 versus 31.8% for V2—so the factorial interpretation is not clean even before accounting for the post-outcome addition of MIXH.
